  "comparison_method": "Complete aligned function extents with actual COFF relocations materialized to independently identified original addresses; no instruction masks. Regression additionally compares raw instruction bytes and relocation offsets/types/addends/external identities. Compiler-generated same-function label names are compared by their actual function-relative destination offsets. Unknown emitted functions are rejected by the strict comparator.",
  "semantic_contract": [
    "Each vector input is unsigned16, hence the mathematical subtraction lies in [-65535,65535]. Explicitly widening both operands to signed64 before subtracting and then casting the comparisons to signed32 preserves every input result and flag predicate.",
    "The flag values0,256,257 fit unsigned16; shifts are by lane indices0 through7 and produce at most0x8080, so narrowing the local flag variable does not alter the architectural16-bit flag updates.",
    "These are source-equivalent compiler diagnostics. Their failure to match is not evidence that the underlying arithmetic behavior differs."
  ],
